  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      Most people assume Psychology is automatically an Arts-stream subject. For BA Psychology, that is true only in the sense that any stream can apply. For BSc Psychology, it is often the reverse - a Science-stream 12th, sometimes specifically PCB or PCM, is a stated requirement at many universities. If you enjoyed the biological and statistical side of your PCB subjects, BSc Psychology is usually the closer fit, not BA.
    </p>
  </div>

